<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA LEAD MOROCCO 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA LEAD MOROCCO 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>OSIJEK, Croatia 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia took a 2-0 lead</p>
<p>over Marocco in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one</p>
<p>first round tie after winning the opening singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Sasa Hirszon beat Karim Alami 6-4 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic beat Hachim Arazi 6-2 6-2 6-7 (4-7) 6-2</p>
</text>
